title: tiddlywiki filter
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Calling `$tw.wiki.filterTiddlers` from a notebook cell will return a snapshot of the filter results and it won't update unless the notebook tiddler is refreshed. This example uses `notebook-kit`'s `Generators.observe` to glue the two reactivity systems together.

